n\nCovering it would require prohibited reflection, shadow classes, or overriding the resolved dependency version. The existing test already exercises the nearest supported path and successfully reaches the object logger-reconfiguration method itself. Tests were not run, per instruction.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0f53c12e46bce6a9016a9a686c010487d28836fe84a4f2f3aa\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 2974, "output": 1168, "cacheRead": 78208, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1013, "totalTokens": 82350, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1788504149904, "responseId": "resp_0f53c12e46bce6a9016a9a685631f087d2aabd7fba28de650f", "rawStopReason": "completed"}}
