dy.\n\nInspect:\n- `logs/org.springframework.cloud:spring-cloud-vault-config:5.0.2/add-new-library-support/pi-generation-2026-09-04T06-04-21-451035Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.cloud:spring-cloud-vault-config:5.0.2/gradle/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-09-04T06-46-28-202039Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.cloud:spring-cloud-vault-config:5.0.2/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-09-04T06-45-08-301896Z.log`\n- `stats/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/execution-metrics.json`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Confirm from `VaultConfigDataLoader` and Spring Vault `4.0.3` sources whether line 424 has any supported public-API path; add a consumer-like test only if one exists.\n2. If the call is genuinely unreachable, accept/document the exhausted call site and complete metadata finalization, including splitting test-only metadata.\n3. Run coordinate-scoped metadata validation, dynamic-access reporting, and the full JVM/native test lane before publication.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e7c3734ea59253b016a9a6a247b2c87d2812784c8de83e709\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 30993, "output": 1533, "cacheRead": 210560, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 999, "totalTokens": 243086, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1788504592354, "responseId": "resp_0e7c3734ea59253b016a9a6a11054487d29259916d3587815d", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
